# Ignore everything in .sentinal/ except shared project memory, the runtime
# contract, rules, and skills.
#
# ⛔ HAND-MAINTAINED. `!continue-here.md` is a deliberate local customisation
# (see docs/plans/2026-07-19-sentinal-gitignore-track-skills-rules.md:28), so
# this file matches neither GITIGNORE_CONTENT nor any KNOWN_PRIOR_GITIGNORES
# entry in src/memory/shared.ts and `ensureGitignore` will NEVER auto-upgrade
# it. Mirror every generator change here by hand. The regression tests in
# src/memory/shared.test.ts ("this repo's own .sentinal/.gitignore (R9)") are
# what stop that hand-maintenance rotting silently.
*
!.gitignore
!project-memory.json
!runtime.json
!continue-here.md
!rules
!rules/
!rules/**
!skills
!skills/
!skills/**
